# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Credentials
#
# The Supabase service-role key bypasses Row-Level Security entirely. This
# repository is public, so a key that reaches its history can only be remedied
# by rotating the key — deleting the commit does not reach forks or caches.
# Keep every credential in .env.local, which is never committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Supabase CLI local state
#
# .temp/ holds the linked project ref and CLI scratch state; .branches/ holds
# local branch databases. Neither belongs in version control.
# Migrations and config.toml DO belong in version control.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.branches/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dependencies and build output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
build/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor and OS noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
*.log
